==Usage==
<pre>{{icon|name of icon}}</pre>

To update the available icons, the [[Module:Icons|Icon]] module requires a new parameter in the <code>iconTip</code> (default tooltip) and <code>gameIcon</code> (icon filename) lists. 

==Available icons==
{{#invoke:Icons|documentation}}

In addition, all abbreviations supported by {{tl|Abb}} can be used to produce an icon for the corresponding game.

==Technical==
This template is a wrapper for [[Module:Icons]] and doesn't have any functionality beyond the function call. It should be used over a direct invocation on article spaces supported by Visual Editor, not doing so will lead to breakages by Visual Editor as it tries to translate the function part of the <code><nowiki>{{#invoke:}}</nowiki></code> incorrectly. When placing icons within another template, use the direct invoke to reduce resource overhead.